  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.2 — Security, validation, and documentation:\n• RequireResponseSignature option (default: true) — fail-closed HMAC-MD5 response verification\n• AllowInsecureHttp option (default: false) — HTTPS-only enforcement at startup\n• Domain model validation (Card, Client, Product) with Validate/ValidateAndThrow/IsValid API\n• Card validation: Luhn algorithm, PAN length, expiry date, CVV format\n• ValidationException with structured Errors list\n• Certificate pinning via ServerCertificateCustomValidationCallback\n• XSS protection in PaymentFormBuilder (HTML and JSON encoding)\n• SignatureException properties changed to internal (prevents information leaks)\n• WayForPayOptionsValidator: required fields, HTTP rejection, timeout range validation\n• Webhook HandleAsync: 4 overloads with optional ILogger support\n• Comprehensive README with examples for all 18 API operations\n• 1,066 lines of new unit tests (Card, Client, Product, Options, FormBuilder security)",
